    card title "More than one"

A: How do you say more than one in Russian? Start with one cat: кот.
    draw o_cat o_kot

B: Three cats are коты́: the ы at the end says more than one.
    draw o_cats o_koty

A: Ы, as in ты and вы: say the i of bit, with your tongue pulled back.
    draw y_card y_gl

    erase o_cat o_kot o_cats o_koty y_card y_gl

A: English adds an s. Russian changes the endin (@draw h_y h_i h_a@)g, and three endings do most of the work: ы, и and а.

A: A word that ends in a consonant adds ы: кот, коты́; стол, столы́.
    draw r_kot r_stol

B: A word in а swaps it for ы: ма́ма, ма́мы.
    draw r_mama

A: But after к, г, х, ж, ш, ч and щ, Russian spelling won’t write ы.
    draw r_rule

A: It writes и instead: кни́га, кни́ги.
    draw r_kniga

B: A word in я takes и too: неде́ля, a week; неде́ли, weeks.
    draw r_ned

A: The оно́ words go their own way: окно́ ends in о, and windows are о́кна.
    draw r_okno r_okno_b

B: Hear the stress jump to the front: окно́, о́кна.
    highlight r_okno_b part ^о effect underline color #8f887c

B: And мо́ре, with its е, takes я: моря́, seas.
    draw r_more

    hide board

A: Now one word for all of them: они́, they. Он, она́ or оно́; cats, books or windows: many of them are они́.
    draw p_on p_ona p_ono p_arrow oni oni_pics

    erase oni_pics

B: In lesson eight, my had three forms: мой, моя́ and моё.
    draw m_moy m_moya m_moyo

A: In the plural, he, she and it fold into one, just as they did in они́.
    highlight oni

A: So my has one plural form too: мои́, ending in и.
    draw m_arrow m_moi

B: Э́то мои́ кни́ги: these are my books. Э́то stays the same, even for many.
    draw phrase ph_books

    hide part2

    draw sort

    ask "Which ending does each word take for more than one? Sort each word into its box." on sort store s stage own voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: {s} right on the first try.
        wrong: {s} of {s.total} on the first try.

    erase sort

    draw q_cats

    quiz "Fill the gap for my cats: Э́то мои́ ___." reveal.text "мои́ коты́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: A word that ends in a consonant adds ы.
        wrong: Кот ends in т, a consonant, and т is not on the и list.
        * кот
        + коты́
        * коти

    erase q_cats question_2_stamp

    draw q_books

    ask "One book is кни́га. Type the word for books." answer ["книги"] reveal.text кни́ги reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: After г, Russian writes и, not ы.
        wrong: Кни́га has г before its а, and г is on the и list.

    erase q_books question_3_stamp

    draw q_wins

    quiz "Окно́ is a window. Which word means windows?" reveal.text о́кна reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Оно́ words change their о to а.
        wrong: Окно́ is an оно́ word, not a he or a she, so ы is out.
        * окны
        + о́кна
        * окно́

    erase q_wins question_4_stamp

    draw q_text

    quiz "What does Они́ на столе́ mean?" say_answer false reveal.text "= they are on the table" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 50 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: They are on the table: они́ is they, and на столе́ is on the table, from lesson nine.
        wrong: Он is he and она́ is she; они́ is the word for many.
        + They are on the table
        * He is on the table
        * She is on the table

    erase q_text question_5_stamp

    draw s_cats parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase s_cats

    show board

A: So more than one lives in the ending: ы for most words, и after к, г and their friends, а or я for the оно́ words.
    highlight h_y h_i h_a

    hide board

B: And whoever they are, they’re они́. Мои́ коты́ say пока́!
    group e_cats members ["e_c1","e_c2","e_c3"]
    text e_say "Мои́ коты́!" #3d3833 say "Мои коты!" say_voice b colors {"и$":"#3f7f4f","ы$":"#3f7f4f"} x 500 y 560 font_size 70

